1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
مَنْ لَا يَشْكُرِ النَّاسَ لَا يَشْكُرِ اللَّهَ

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,840
That's what the Prophet ﷺ said

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:08,400
Whoever doesn't thank the people,

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,620
doesn't thank Allah سُبْحَانَهُ وَتَعَالَى

5
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,900
So how do you

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:12,820
teach your children

7
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:13,950
to thank you?

8
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:14,700
First,

9
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,180
let them hear it from us.

10
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,180
When your child

11
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,200
brings something,

12
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,760
say “thank you.”

13
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:20,950
When they help you,

14
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:21,900
say “thank you

15
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,660
for helping me.”

16
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,240
Children learn a lot

17
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,780
from what they see us do.

18
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:26,940
Then teach them

19
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:27,440
to notice

20
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,400
when someone makes

21
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,700
something kind for them.

22
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,220
Mum made your food?

23
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,440
Say “thank you.”

24
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,680
Dad helped you?

25
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:34,800
Say “thank you.”

26
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,900
And remind them,

27
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,100
when you thank the people

28
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,100
for something good

29
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,020
they do for you,

30
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,500
Allah سُبْحَانَهُ وَتَعَالَى

31
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,600
loves that from you,

32
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:42,820
and you are rewarded

33
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,200
for doing what the Prophet

34
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,440
ﷺ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّمَ

35
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,240
taught us to do.

36
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:47,200
So today,

37
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,020
don't just ask your child

38
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:49,980
to say “thank you.”

39
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,460
Say it to them first.
